                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The game looked cool but sadly playing it wasn't all that fun. Half the time stuff was blowing up and coming towards me, and i had no idea what was going on. You keep on dieing by things that are unclear and are barely visible. I played a very short time, cause i saw no point in playing it anymore. The layout is still very much a mobile port at this stage as well. So right now i would not recommend buying it, frankly not even on a sale. unless they make things more clearer and cleaner on the screen.",
